# International applet (MAIN.CPL dialog 3): third in the window (Mouse, Keyboard, International).
# Same keys as arch311-ref/scn/intl-open.scn (index 7 in real 3.11). Run with
# ARCH311_CLOCK="2026-10-08 09:30:24" (the reference's clock when the dialog opened).
sleep 600
key right
key right
key enter
sleep 600
shot shots/01-open.png
key esc
sleep 300
shot shots/02-closed.png
quit
